## Reflection

This project is the opposite of a multiplexer, it swaps the amount inputs and outputs.

I learned how a single control signal determines which output receives the input signal. This helped me better understand how digital systems distribute data between different hardware components.

## Problems

No major problems occurred during this project.

The main challenge was understanding the difference between a multiplexer and a demultiplexer. After comparing both circuits and analyzing the simulation results, their opposite behavior became much clearer.

It was harder to find sources on the code, eventually landed on slideshare.

